  {
    "name": "POST /api/MedianPlan/v1/performanceForecasts - 代理调用Amazon Performance预测（需真实Amazon账号,仅生成不确保通过）",
    "description": "单接口测试：POST /api/MedianPlan/v1/performanceForecasts。直接代理转发至 Amazon Ads 原生 Media Planning Performance Forecast API（非 Pacvue 侧持久化操作，无需清理）。ES 365天0命中，Swagger 无 example。AmazonAdsAccountId / AmazonAdsManagerAccountId 为该接口必需但当前测试账号config中无对应真实值，标记 [NEEDS_REAL_VALUE]，若人工核实到真实值需替换后重跑；其余字段（CountryCode/日期/Targets）按 Swagger 结构 + 同模块 save 接口的关键词定向样例构造，非猜测业务含义。真实执行结果：ReachType/DeliveryType按报错枚举修正为HOUSEHOLDS/NON_GUARANTEED后，最终报错 code=500 msg=\"The `Amazon-Ads-AccountId` request header is in an invalid format.\"——证实 AmazonAdsAccountId 确需真实有效值，[NEEDS_REAL_VALUE]占位无法通过，如实记录为FAIL。",
    "module": "MedianPlan",
    "granularity": "API",
    "since": "init",
    "last_modified": "init",
    "change_type": "NEW",
    "generated_by": "swagger-api-case",
    "steps": [
      {
        "name": "代理调用Amazon Performance预测",
        "method": "POST",
        "base_url": "{{base_urls.BASEURL}}",
        "headers": "{{headers}}",
        "path": "/MedianPlan/v1/performanceForecasts",
        "request_body": {
          "ProfileId": "{{variables.profile_id}}",
          "AmazonAdsAccountId": "[NEEDS_REAL_VALUE]",
          "AmazonAdsManagerAccountId": "[NEEDS_REAL_VALUE]",
